Day 11 — Step 2: Connect Risk Analyzer to Network Monitor

Your current architecture is roughly:

Network Monitor
      ↓
Network Connection Data
      ↓
Risk Analyzer
      ↓
Risk Score + Risk Level + Reasons

Right now, you have tested the Risk Analyzer independently.

Now we make the actual network_monitor.py send each network connection to the analyzer.

Step 1 — Open

In VS Code:

ACTDRS
 └── analyzer
      └── network_analyzer.py

Make sure your analyzer contains the function you just tested, something like:

def calculate_network_risk(
    status,
    process_name,
    destination_ip,
    destination_port
